                "text": "The @HouseGOP wants to slash $767M from HIV/AIDS care, prevention, and treatment\u2014dramatically reducing access to lifesaving care for the estimated 1.2M Americans living with HIV.\n\u00a0\nI\u2019m proud to join @RepMaxineWaters in fighting against this needless cut that would reverse our progress towards the eradication of HIV.",
