                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today is National Transgender HIV Testing Day. \n\nWith transgender people being 13X more likely than the general population to be HIV positive globally, it\u2019s important to recognize the unique barriers they face in receiving HIV testing, treatment, and care. \n\nAs the Vice Chair of the @EqualityCaucus, I\u2019m proud to fight for expanding access to the comprehensive HIV care trans Americans need.",
