                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "R\u00fcmeysa\u2019s firsthand account of her experience in an ICE detention center sheds much needed light on how ICE is treating people in their custody. I commend R\u00fcmeysa for her resilience and powerful essay.\n\nICE\u2019s cruel and inhumane treatment of people in their custody, like R\u00fcmeysa, is a betrayal of our values and a stain on our country\u2019s history.",
